Conflicts: mpv
Description: complete SDE desktop and DebION GNU/Linux application profile
 One installation entry point for the native SDE applications and DebION's
 complementary desktop applications, network, PipeWire audio, Bluetooth,
 printing, display manager, DNS and time synchronization services.
 .
 Firefox uses the regular Mozilla release channel. Celluloid uses libmpv;
 the separate mpv player package is excluded from this desktop profile.
 Papirus is the default icon theme. Upstream desktop files place additional
 applications in their own menu categories automatically.
 .
 Install debion-desktop-defaults and refresh APT before installing this
 metapackage, so the official Mozilla Firefox repository is available.
 See /usr/share/doc/debion-desktop-defaults/DEBION.md for installation.

Package: debion-desktop-defaults
Architecture: all
Section: metapackages
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ca-certificates
Description: DebION SDE desktop integration and repository defaults
 Configures the signed official Mozilla Firefox repository, package policy,
 LightDM with Slick Greeter, NetworkManager with systemd-resolved and the
 preferred terminal for SDE. Package sources already present and individual
 user preferences are preserved. No repositories are contacted by maintainer
 scripts; refresh APT explicitly after installing this package.
